# local-llm

An LLM inside the Node process. No daemon, no API key, no port.

- Public entry points: `local-llm` (core), `local-llm/ai` (AI SDK provider), `local-llm/testing` (mocks).
- Source lives in `src/`. Import it with the `@/` alias (`@/core/local-llm.js`), never with `../`.
- Tests live in `tests/`: `tests/unit` (no network, no real model) and `tests/e2e` (opt-in with `LOCAL_LLM_E2E=1`).
- Read `process.env` only through `src/env.ts`.
- Runtime is Node 20+ for the published package. Development uses Bun (`bun run verify`).
- `PLAN.md` is the source of the milestones. `DECISIONS.md` records every deviation from it.
